e this to present the choices before select_browser.",inputSchema:{type:"object",properties:{},required:[]}},{name:"select_browser",description:"Select a specific Chrome browser by deviceId for browser automation, without broadcasting a pairing request. Use this after list_connected_browsers when the user has chosen one from the list.",inputSchema:{type:"object",properties:{deviceId:{type:"string",description:"The deviceId from list_connected_browsers."}},required:["deviceId"]}}];
